  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would constitute an overly dominant addition that would fail to relate subordinately and would completely erode the character and charm of the property resulting in a contrived and top heavy appearance that would result in significant harm to the character and appearance of the streetscene and the Conservation Area. The proposal would be unacceptable in terms of its design quality contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2, CC4 and SC7 as well as the design guidance contained within the Residential Extension Guidelines and the Hanworth Park Conservation Area Appraisal.",
    "Reason : 2 - The provision of a roof level balcony in this location would result in a loss of privacy to neighbouring residents, to the detriment of their living conditions above that of the existing situation contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 and SC7."
